                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Edited Review:\n\nOkay, they updated the translation. It used to be literally incomprehensible (and I don't use that word in vain). It's still pretty much not perfect now, but it's MUCH better than before. At least you can understand it, and you can appreciate the tongue-in-cheek tones now. You did great, devs. I commend you. Unlike some other developers, you don't just abandon things or make excuses when people flame you because of your bad translation (yes, people do that).\n\nSo the game is a pretty unique-looking RPG with maudlin yet joking tone about escaped Demon Lord who fight against human tyrany. I can dig it.\n\nOnce again, I appreciate this.\n\nOld review:\n\nHonestly it looks really good and unique, but the english version is pretty much incomprehensible by combination of awkward translation, grammar mistakes, and straight up abundance of typos.\n\nI'm pretty sure it's good in the original language. So please, please, please, if you're actually listing it in english, please find someone who can translate this better, because I really want to play it and understand what's going on.",
